<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 348 mln one-year bonds on Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 348 mln one-year bonds on Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland is offering 348 million zlotys worth of one-year index-linked bonds, maturing March 4, 1998, at tender on February 25, 1997, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>It said the value date for the auction will be on March 3, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
